WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:01.520
What...

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.480
<b>A raging god...</b>

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.980
...is...

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.980
<b>A fierce warrior...</b>

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:08.480
...going on?

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.480
<b>Collapses.</b>

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:14.900
You're really Kan'u, right?

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.000
The spell failed?

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:50.790
You bastard!

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:52.340
Wait!

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:54.780
Damn it.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.510
A little more and he would've been mine.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:58.760
Damn...

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.340
A meddler interfered.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:04.160
What did you do to my body?!

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:05.200
Hakuanshi,

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.890
I've got business with one of your cards.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.770
If you don't want to get hurt,
show me all of them!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.360
Brat...

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:13.160
We're leaving, Ukitsu.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.230
There's nothing more for us to do here.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.030
Yes, sir.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.280
Gogyou Circle!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.920
What's this?

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:27.640
You will die here in the Southern Palace!

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.080
I guess you want to do this the hard way!

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:32.040
Wha—

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.050
I'm paying you back for last time.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.810
Shuu Koukin!

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.980
Are you Gien?

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.570
Gien has been strengthened 
by your spiritual energy.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.130
He's stronger than last time!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:58.670
Wait!

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.160
Sorry, but you guys can handle this!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.410
Don't you want to follow him?

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.910
I'll finish things with you first!

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.500
Ryou'un, do you know
a way to get out of here?

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:19.800
I think there's a hole to 
Suikyou-sensei's world somewhere.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.780
Go find it now, please.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:24.280
I'll fight, too.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.670
With your spiritual energy, 
that's impossible right now!

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:29.310
And if we can't find that hole,

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.210
we'll all be crushed.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.960
I hate to say it, but he's right!

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.990
Please, Ryou'un!

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.320
Hey, wait!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.200
We're not done yet!

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:48.450
Do you think a mere Earth-type can beat me?

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.240
Don't be in such a hurry.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:56.780
Or was I not supposed to find out that you 
don't have much spiritual energy left?

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.460
What?

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.370
Damn it!

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:00.340
What's going on?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.380
Hakuanshi-sama, run!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.830
Wait! Damn it!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.100
Wait!

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.440
Just a stupid illusion?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.140
I don't now about that.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.680
You're already a prisoner 
of the space I created!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.680
Damn it!

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.180
Shuuyu!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.600
Are you okay?

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:31.550
Yeah.

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:33.120
But I can't defend you anymore.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.210
Run without me.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.920
I can't leave you here.

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:38.850
Don't try to show off when 
you're a good-for-nothing.

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.710
A tragic goodbye...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:44.920
But I'll show you that emotions 
aren't enough to bring you victory!

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.970
If Ryou'un dies inside that,

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.790
the rest of Kan'u will 
automatically become mine.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.100
But still...

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:55.990
I didn't think they'd push me this far.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.400
That ain't fair!

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.610
I can feel your fear!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.480
Now I will stimulate it further!

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.240
Stop!

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.010
What are you doing?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.140
So this woman is your weak point?

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.940
I'll murder you!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:15.620
Nonsense!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.500
What can you do?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.980
I can do it...

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.480
I just didn't want to.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:26.880
Shuuyu!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.490
This is a battle of souls!

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:34.010
All you do is give power 
to your general, coward.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.580
There's nothing for you to do.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.520
Coward?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.750
Lords are unneeded in battle!

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:45.030
Do you not like being used by a lord?

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.930
We were once lords of the battlefield,

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:50.420
fighting as we willed.

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:51.780
But what about now?

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.940
We are summoned when our lords are in danger,

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:58.430
and sent back into that gloomy 
place when they're done with us!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.750
We're just stupid tools!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.550
It may be true that we're tools.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.800
But that just means we need 
to meet a good master!

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.130
Shuuyu!

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.100
Stupid!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.700
Have you finally given up?

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.520
I'll finish you off now.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.020
I guess I don't have a choice.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:27.400
Come out!

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:30.780
You had a general?!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:35.490
What is this nasty place?

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:39.710
It's ruining my entrance.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.800
Stop looking at the mirror,
and do something about this!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.360
You're in such a hurry, aren't you?

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:48.540
You got caught by some 
musty old spell, right?

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:50.680
You insolent brat!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.160
Be careful!

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.950
He goes inside generals' bodies!

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.810
I won't give him my body easily.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.140
Curse you! You keep moving around!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:03.130
Then how about this?

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:04.440
Below! Below you!

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:06.400
I won't let you catch me!

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.760
No one likes persistent men!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.490
Oops!

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:15.910
My mirror!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:16.790
Fool!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:17.660
Crap!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.410
Stop!

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.770
Shuuyu!

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:24.670
What's wrong?

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:27.550
Is the bond between you that weak?

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:28.550
Stop it!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.110
If only you'd admitted the 
wrong you'd done and lay there,

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.890
you wouldn't have had to suffer.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.480
You still don't understand

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.240
that it's not just the general 
who's doing the fighting—

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.270
Silence!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:44.900
No matter what you say, you can't win!

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:49.780
I believe in my lord, Sonshin!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:54.000
A general's fate is in 
the hands of their lord!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:54.740
<i>That's right!</i>

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:57.670
<i>I'm the only one who can save Shuuyu now!</i>

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.700
<i>I need to hurry or the 
spiritual energy will vanish,</i>

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.250
<i>and she'll go back to her card!</i>

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:04.960
<i>Is that it?</i>

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:09.380
<i>Maybe I can do it if there's a bond of 
trust between a lord and their general!</i>

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:11.880
Gien!

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:16.010
I'll show you the bond between 
a lord and their general!

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:20.400
What can you and Shuuyu do now?

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.660
Stop it, Sonshin!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.510
I don't even have the spiritual energy 
left to use the Retsuouken!

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:25.520
I told you before, didn't I?

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.770
That our twilight sun hasn't set yet!

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.880
What foolishness is this?

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:33.230
There is no twilight sun here!

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:34.860
This is the end!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:35.360
Shuuyu!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.110
Die!

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.240
Come back to me!

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.200
You're wasting your time!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:43.580
Bringing her back to her 
card changes nothing!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.590
We'll see about that!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.080
Fool! Where are you aiming at?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.970
Go, Shuuyu!

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:53.110
What?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.760
Too bad!

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.240
I won't let you get behind me!

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.430
Shuuyu!

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.560
Come back!

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.230
Again?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.190
Shuuyu, go!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.060
No!

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.570
We got him!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:17.070
S-Splendid...

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.350
But why didn't you strike a fatal point?

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:23.110
The battle was over when I got behind you.

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:25.980
I didn't expect pity.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:26.680
No.

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.610
I simply am showing respect to your fighting.

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:33.090
Without my lord, I would have lost.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.940
You have defeated me, Shuu Koukin.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:40.100
And... your lord, Sonshin!

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.430
No! Get away, Sonshin!

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.310
Gien...

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.270
This is bad!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.840
It's only a matter of time 
before this place is destroyed!

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:53.610
Let's go!

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:55.110
My mirror...

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.560
Forget it!

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:57.860
Nobody cares about your mirror!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.370
Foolish general!

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.120
Your arrogance is your undoing!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.720
Every man needs a mirror at all times.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:08.000
I'll send you to a world 
where you won't need mirrors!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.210
He's coming!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.830
Baryou, are you listening?

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:11.770
Wh—

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:12.710
You can't be!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.490
Are you Baryou of the White Eyebrows?

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.210
Yes.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.220
No!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.470
I-Is this mirror...

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:20.800
Yes.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:24.560
A holy mirror that reflects 
and seals away evil.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.560
Y-You deliberately dropped it there!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.880
I told you,

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.810
every man needs a mirror.

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.320
Did we make it out?

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.070
Okay, I'll be on my way.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.150
Since I can't use my mirror for a while,

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:45.050
I won't be able to fix up my hair.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:46.120
Do whatever you want.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:50.580
Oh, and it will be a bit difficult 
to escape this barrier.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.410
At least, on your own.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:54.090
I ain't asking for your help!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:57.040
Nobody said you should ask me.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.050
Damn it!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.680
I need to hurry!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:03.930
Is there really a hole?

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:06.180
I think it's past this door.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:07.390
Here?

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.010
Yes.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:10.940
No!

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:13.100
It's been sealed!

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:15.570
But what's this big rock?

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:19.440
It's probably a device 
to keep intruders away.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.200
In other words,

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:24.440
we're totally trapped?

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.960
<b>Collapse</b>

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:03.320
A massive rock stands in their way.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.320
Hope is lost,

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.020
and there is no other path.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.800
Everyone comes together

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.250
to stand against this foe.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.490
Dawn comes at last,

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.610
and they meet...

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.360
Next time: "Tomorrow."
